    "body": "Published to Hex.pm: https://hex.pm/packages/ex_ssl/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/elixir_quic/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_core/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/elixir_quic_http3/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_runtime/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_fetch/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_web_socket/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_event_source/0.20.0, https://hex.pm/packages/http_web_transport/0.20.0\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix: stop upload streams on terminal request failures by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/71\n* feat: support HTTPS proxies for HTTP origins by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/73\n* feat: expose conservative pre-send failure evidence by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/72\n* feat: support bounded HTTP2 request upload trailers by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/74\n* feat: confirm pooled HTTP1 and HTTP2 request cleanup by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/75\n* chore: prepare 0.20.0 release and proxy verification by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/76\n* test: correct listener reservations and handshake deadline assertions by @gsmlg in https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/pull/77\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/gsmlg-dev/http_fetch/compare/v0.19.1...v0.20.0",
